# Architectural Consistency Remediation

**Goal**: Align all remaining persistent contexts ([CartContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx#15-32), [NotificationContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/NotificationContext.tsx#23-32), [WishlistContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/WishlistContext.tsx#11-18)) with the multi-tenant architecture used in [OrderContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/OrderContext.tsx#45-56). This ensures that when a user logs out and another logs in, their data (cart, notifications, wishlist) remains isolated and distinct.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change will isolate data by user ID. **Guest users (unauthenticated)** will fallback to a default "guest" storage key or ephemeral state to ensure the app works without login, but their data may be lost or merged upon login depending on future sync logic. For this step, we will use a separate "guest" key.

## Proposed Changes

### Core Contexts

#### [MODIFY] [CartContext.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx)
- Integrate [useAuth](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#246-253) hook.
- Update `localStorage` key to include `user.id` (e.g., `spendigo_cart_${user?.id || 'guest'}`).
- Add `useEffect` to reload items from the correct key when `user.id` changes.

#### [MODIFY] [NotificationContext.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/NotificationContext.tsx)
- Integrate [useAuth](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#246-253) hook.
- Update `localStorage` keys for notifications and preferences to include `user.id`.
- Ensure listeners/effects re-run on user change.

#### [MODIFY] [WishlistContext.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/WishlistContext.tsx)
- Integrate [useAuth](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#246-253) hook.
- Update `localStorage` key to include `user.id`.
- Ensure wishlist items are flushed/reloaded on auth state change.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no TypeScript regressions.

### Manual Verification
1. **Cart Isolation**:
   - Login as User A -> Add Item X -> Logout.
   - Login as User B -> Verify Cart is Empty (or has User B's items).
   - Login as User A -> Verify Item X is present.

2. **Persistence**:
   - Restart browser/reload page and ensure User A's data persists.
